# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere, including on Windows checkouts.
# Without this, git's autocrlf turns every file into CRLF on a Windows runner
# and `prettier --check` fails on all of them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish things git should not touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary

# Keep generated/vendored files out of language stats and diffs.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
demo/*.md linguist-documentation=true
